  "title": "RMA — Data Security Under §63A-19-102",
  "content": "An RMA participant must implement data security measures conforming to Utah Code §63A-19-102 and maintain a cybersecurity framework that is updated on an ongoing basis to address emerging threats and vulnerabilities. No statutory or common-law cybersecurity obligation is waived by the RMA.",
